<Item XName="Amplifier_compression" UserName="Amplifier_compression" Type="Equation">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>% values are PowerIn, DeltaGain (dB) from small signal, Delta Phase (deg)&#x000D;&#x000A;% Extracted from a 2140MHz LDMOS PA in ADS based on a Freescale FET&#x000D;&#x000A;%&#x000D;&#x000A;% you can export CSV files from ADS Data Display, then either cut &amp; paste columns&#x000D;&#x000A;% of numbers from Excel into a math variable here, or you can do a &#x000D;&#x000A;% File/Import/SysParameters/Excel and bring them into a dataset.  The advantage &#x000D;&#x000A;% of that method is now external files to drag around.&#x000D;&#x000A;%&#x000D;&#x000A;Doherty_Normalized = [ ...&#x000D;&#x000A;-10,0,0,...&#x000D;&#x000A;-7.5,-1.65E-04,-0.002,...&#x000D;&#x000A;-5,-4.59E-04,-0.005,...&#x000D;&#x000A;-2.5,-0.001,-0.011,...&#x000D;&#x000A;0,-0.002,-0.022,...&#x000D;&#x000A;2.5,-0.004,-0.041,...&#x000D;&#x000A;5,-0.006,-0.074,...&#x000D;&#x000A;7.5,-0.011,-0.132,...&#x000D;&#x000A;10,-0.02,-0.235,...&#x000D;&#x000A;12.5,-0.035,-0.412,...&#x000D;&#x000A;15,-0.058,-0.715,...&#x000D;&#x000A;16,-0.07,-0.887,...&#x000D;&#x000A;16.5,-0.077,-0.987,...&#x000D;&#x000A;17,-0.084,-1.098,...&#x000D;&#x000A;17.5,-0.092,-1.222,...&#x000D;&#x000A;18,-0.101,-1.359,...&#x000D;&#x000A;18.5,-0.11,-1.512,...&#x000D;&#x000A;19,-0.12,-1.684,...&#x000D;&#x000A;19.5,-0.13,-1.879,...&#x000D;&#x000A;20,-0.141,-2.102,...&#x000D;&#x000A;20.5,-0.154,-2.36,...&#x000D;&#x000A;21,-0.169,-2.663,...&#x000D;&#x000A;21.5,-0.186,-3.026,...&#x000D;&#x000A;22,-0.207,-3.465,...&#x000D;&#x000A;22.5,-0.235,-4.001,...&#x000D;&#x000A;23,-0.272,-4.656,...&#x000D;&#x000A;23.5,-0.321,-5.451,...&#x000D;&#x000A;24,-0.385,-6.394,...&#x000D;&#x000A;24.5,-0.466,-7.483,...&#x000D;&#x000A;25,-0.566,-8.699,...&#x000D;&#x000A;25.5,-0.682,-10.013,...&#x000D;&#x000A;26,-0.813,-11.398,...&#x000D;&#x000A;26.5,-0.958,-12.834,...&#x000D;&#x000A;27,-1.117,-14.281,...&#x000D;&#x000A;27.5,-1.29,-15.653,...&#x000D;&#x000A;28,-1.47,-16.83,...&#x000D;&#x000A;28.5,-1.643,-17.716,...&#x000D;&#x000A;29,-1.799,-18.254,...&#x000D;&#x000A;