<Item XName="EquationText" Type="PartParam">
<DataEntry>% this PA model uses direct large-signal S21 gain &amp; phase&#x000D;&#x000A;% (not normalized)&#x000D;&#x000A;%&#x000D;&#x000A;thisPowerDBM=30+10*log10(abs(input)^2/(2*Rref));&#x000D;&#x000A;%&#x000D;&#x000A;gainDB=interp1(Pdata,Gdata,thisPowerDBM);&#x000D;&#x000A;phaseRAD=interp1(Pdata,Adata,thisPowerDBM)*pi/180;&#x000D;&#x000A;gainpolar=10^(gainDB/20)*exp(i*phaseRAD);&#x000D;&#x000A;%&#x000D;&#x000A;output=input*gainpolar;&#x000D;&#x000A;</DataEntry>
<Description>Equation Text to Parse, edited in the equation set</Description>
<DocSymbol />
<IsSettable><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></IsSettable>
<Range />
<RunTimeTunable><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></RunTimeTunable>
<Show><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Show>
<Validate><T>Int</T><D>4</D></Validate></Item>
